{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "42897bef-3a58-8fc4-9713-b9db7c1794b4",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T10:35:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kwame Abdi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:32:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:33:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I am Kwame Abdi. I get a letter. Shutoff warning. For water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:33:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. Do you have the letter in front of you? What's the address on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:33:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have the paper. Four twenty-five Memorial Boulevard. I am the landlord. Not living there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:33:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Four twenty-five Memorial. Can you read me the date on the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:33:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] The date is December second. And a second date, shutoff, it says January ninth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:33:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so that's your due date and then the date they'd move to shut off if it isn't settled. So you've got until about the ninth of January."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:33:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "January ninth. So I have, how many days? Ten days? Eleven? I must know how much time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:33:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "From today, it's about ten days. Not a lot, but enough to get it sorted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:33:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. But the charge is too high. Too much. The house, it is empty two months. Nobody uses water. Why this big number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:34:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, I see the balance here. Sometimes a high bill comes from a running toilet or a leak, or an estimated reading. I can't tell from my screen which it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:34:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No leak. I check. I want a supervisor. Someone look at this charge. Please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:34:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's fair. Let me see if my supervisor is at her desk. Hang on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:34:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I wait. [pause] I have many things today. Bank, post office, hardware store. I check them one by one. This is next."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:34:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds like a full list. Okay, she's on another call. I can put in a request for a review and have her call you back. Is this the best number, the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:34:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four zero one, five five five, zero one nine four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:34:52-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, got it. I'll note the account, the shutoff date, and that you're disputing the charge, so it's on hold while they look. She'll call you today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:35:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Today or tomorrow. Thank you. I wait for the call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:35:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Abdi. Good luck with the rest of your errands."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:35:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
